[
{
"id": 16901,
"en": "I'm glad you did, honestly.\nWhat about your bar?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16902,
"en": "It's all regulars over there right now.\nThey'll be fine without me for a bit.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16903,
"en": "Do you have a child of your own?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16904,
"en": "You seem good with them.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16905,
"en": "I babysat for a friend a while ago...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16906,
"en": "Oh! I should be heading back to the bar.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16907,
"en": "Have a good night.\nYou should try to get some rest.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16908,
"en": "You'll need your energy to look for\nHaruto's dad tomorrow, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16909,
"en": "Yeah, thanks.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b24|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16910,
"en": "See you, then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16911,
"en": "(I guess I'll just have to walk around and\nhope I find a lead on Haruto's dad...)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16912,
"en": "(Kiyomi's bar is right near here.\nI should stop by and thank her.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16913,
"en": "(Oh, right. The bar wouldn't\nbe open at this time of day.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16914,
"en": "Ah! Just the guy I was looking for.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16915,
"en": "I was on my way to see you, Kiryu-san.\nI have a favor to ask.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16916,
"en": "Of me? What is it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16917,
"en": "Kiryu-san... Can you play baseball?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16918,
"en": "Hm, I know the rules at least.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16919,
"en": "Well, Ino-kun's on a local team, and they\nhave a match to play today.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16920,
"en": "One of their players is sick, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16921,
"en": "So, he asked me to see if you'd help out.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16922,
"en": "They want me to fill in?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16923,
"en": "No problem. This should help repay you\nguys for how kind you've been to me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16924,
"en": "Sorry. I don't mean to guilt trip you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16925,
"en": "And the game's right now?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16926,
"en": "Yeah, I'll walk you over to the field.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16927,
"en": "I have to get ready first, though.\nCan you wait for me by the ropeway station?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16928,
"en": "The ropeway...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16929,
"en": "I'll meet you there soon.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16930,
"en": "Okay, see you in a few.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16931,
"en": "(This is a good way to repay Kiyomi and Ino.\nI need to find this ropeway...)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16932,
"en": "Kiryu-san. Sorry to keep you waiting.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16933,
"en": "I just got here myself.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16934,
"en": "Thank you for doing this. I know you're\nbusy looking for Haruto's dad right now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16935,
"en": "Well, there should be plenty of\nlocals at the game, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16936,
"en": "It might be a good opportunity to\nask about Haruka.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16937,
"en": "I'm glad that's how you feel.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16938,
"en": "Okay, let's get going.\nI'll show you up to the field.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16939,
"en": "Yo, Kiryu-san. Thanks fer comin'. One of\nour guys came down with somethin' today.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16940,
"en": "Y'can just think of this as\nyou payin' yer rent.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16941,
"en": "Right, it's a fair trade.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16942,
"en": "Ino-kun, there's no call for that\nattitude with Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16943,
"en": "Gimme a break, Kiyo-chan.\nI know that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16944,
"en": "Either way, he agreed to this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16945,
"en": "Not like y'gotta come to this guy's\nrescue all the time, eh, Kiyo-chan?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16946,
"en": "Mind your own business, Ino-kun.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16947,
"en": "Cold as ice...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16948,
"en": "Anyway, yer gonna be playin'\nright field, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16949,
"en": "Shouldn't see much action out there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16950,
"en": "We're just havin' a fun,\ncasual game today.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16951,
"en": "Really? Your opponents\nseem to have another idea.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16952,
"en": "Look, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16953,
"en": "Well ain't this an interestin' twist?\nWe jus' can't seem t'escape each other.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16954,
"en": "This town really is small, huh?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16955,
"en": "Kiyo-chan. What're y'doin' messin'\naround with this guy again?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16956,
"en": "Why? 'Cause you're not okay with it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16957,
"en": "'Course it ain't okay!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16958,
"en": "Look, Kiyo-chan.\nY'know damn well how I feel 'bout ya!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16959,
"en": "Bothers me t'see ya cuddlin' up t'him.\nCan't ya put yerself in my shoes here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16960,
"en": "Hey! Quit creepin' on her, Nagumo!\nKiyo-chan ain't fallin' for a fool like you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16961,
"en": "Y'think I care what ya say, dumbass!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16962,
"en": "Y'oughta watch yerself from now on.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16963,
"en": "Kiyomi's bar is off-limits t'ya now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16964,
"en": "If I ever see ya 'round there again,\nI'm gon' smash yer face in.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16965,
"en": "He really can't help himself...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16966,
"en": "Are we playing this game or what?\nYour bench is that way.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16967,
"en": "I know jus' fine where it is!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16968,
"en": "Cap, can't you give it a rest?\nEveryone's waiting for us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16969,
"en": "Sure. This game's gon'\nbe one for the records!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16970,
"en": "Hey, did somethin' happen\nwith you n' Nagumo?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16971,
"en": "No, he really wants to fight me, though.\nAnyway, do you play these guys often?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16972,
"en": "Aren't they yakuza?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16973,
"en": "The only yakuza're the three Hirose guys.\nRest of 'em are all civilians.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16974,
"en": "By the by, Nagumo takes this baseball\nstuff real serious-like.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16975,
"en": "I got yer back, no matter what.\nY'don't gotta worry 'bout that jackass.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16976,
"en": "He's... amazing.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16977,
"en": "What the?\nIs this guy for real...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16978,
"en": "The game's over, Nagumo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16979,
"en": "Y'don't get... to decide...\nwhen this ends...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16980,
"en": "Nice goin' today!\nI'll see ya later.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16981,
"en": "Sorry about that.\nI completely ruined your game.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16982,
"en": "Nah, don't even sweat it.\nIt ain't yer fault, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16983,
"en": "Y'know though, yer real freakin' strong!\nYa took on a pack of yakuza and won!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16984,
"en": "Hopefully that lesson got through\neven Nagumo's thick skull.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16985,
"en": "He's right. Nagumo-kun is the one\nwho should apologize.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16986,
"en": "I'm disappointed in his behavior problem\nlately. Maybe I'll stop letting him in the bar.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16987,
"en": "Oh, good one, Kiyo-chan! Nagumo's gon'\nbe drier than a desert without his booze!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16988,
"en": "By the way, Ino-kun.\nDid you find anything?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16989,
"en": "Oops, almost forgot, Kiryu-san.\nI asked 'round about that picture fer ya.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16990,
"en": "The guys on the team said they ain't\never seen this girl 'round here, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16991,
"en": "I see. Thanks, I'll try asking elsewhere.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16992,
"en": "Y'know, we're gon' have a team party\nafter this. Y'all wanna tag along?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16993,
"en": "Sorry, I'll have to pass.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16994,
"en": "There's something else I need to be doing.\nI have to find this kid's father.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16995,
"en": "I'll have to pass too, then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16996,
"en": "Y'sure? Well, if y'need anythin' over at\nthe apartment, jus' holler, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16997,
"en": "Yer part of our group now. So long as\ny'don't make a move on Kiyo-chan, that is.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16998,
"en": "Right, I'll keep that in mind.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16999,
"en": "I guess you still don't have\nany clues about Haruka-chan.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17000,
"en": "Yeah. At this rate, I'm starting to wonder\nif Haruka was even here to begin with.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17001,
"en": "This isn't exactly a big town.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17002,
"en": "Yet I haven't found even a single person\nwho's laid eyes on Haruka.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17003,
"en": "Maybe she just passed through. That\nwould explain why nobody knows her.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17004,
"en": "And if that were the case, it's pretty\nunlikely I'll find Haruto's dad here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17005,
"en": "I'm heading back to the apartment.\nI need to get changed.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17006,
"en": "Right. Well, do you think you\ncould stop by my bar afterward?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17007,
"en": "I'm sure you worked up an appetite today.\nYou deserve a meal for all your help.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17008,
"en": "You don't need to do that for me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17009,
"en": "It's okay. I want to spend some\nmore time with Haruto-kun, too.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17010,
"en": "Okay then.\nWell, I'll see you in a bit.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17011,
"en": "(I guess I should head to Kiyomi's bar...)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17012,
"en": "Welcome back. Please.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17013,
"en": "Hey, Mama...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17014,
"en": "Yes?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17015,
"en": "Why is there never anyone else here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17016,
"en": "You don't mince words, huh?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17017,
"en": "It's not just my bar, though. The whole\ndistrict has been on the decline for years.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17018,
"en": "These days, young people prefer the\ncabaret clubs in other cities to bars here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17019,
"en": "Guess I should actually pay\nmy bill this time, then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17020,
"en": "Didn't I say it would be my treat?\nDon't embarrass me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17021,
"en": "My regulars still come by often.\nI make enough to support myself.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17022,
"en": "Have you always run this place alone?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17023,
"en": "Yeah, I suppose I have.\nAnyway, how about a drink?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17024,
"en": "You can really throw 'em back, Haruto.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17025,
"en": "Sorry fer intrudin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17026,
"en": "Wh-What's going on here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17027,
"en": "We're from the Masuzoe Family.\nNagumo's been a real bad kid.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17028,
"en": "I'm Patriarch Masuzoe.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17029,
"en": "We gotta have some words, Mama.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17030,
"en": "With me?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17031,
"en": "Well, it's kinda complex. Could y'ask\nyer friend here to step out for a bit?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17032,
"en": "I'm tellin' ya t'leave.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17033,
"en": "I don't take orders from you. I'm not\nin the way. Just go about your business.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17034,
"en": "Oh yeah? I don't mind doin' just that,\nbut yer not gonna like what y'see.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17035,
"en": "K-Kiyo-chan... Sorry.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17036,
"en": "The rumors're spot-on.\nY'really are easy on the eyes.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17037,
"en": "I can see why y'wouldn't wanna go\ncollectin' dues from her, Nagumo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17038,
"en": "But that ain't an excuse fer ya to be keepin'\nyer family's payments from me, y'hear?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17039,
"en": "Don't gimme that. I'm the patriarch of\nthe Yomei Alliance's Masuzoe Family.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17040,
"en": "Why've I gotta come remindin' some two-bit\nfamily of imbeciles to pay their dues, huh!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17041,
"en": "The money's late 'cause yer too soft t'collect.\nQuit dickin' me around!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17042,
"en": "O-Our patriarch's holdin' on to the cash fer\nnow. Just gimme a little more time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17043,
"en": "(Where did they go?\nThey couldn't be too far by now...)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17044,
"en": "Ino-san was runnin' around here\nlike he saw a ghost or somethin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17045,
"en": "Y'think the Hirose Family's in trouble?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17046,
"en": "There's some huge group o' yakuza\noutside the Hirose house!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17047,
"en": "Y'should probly steer clear.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17048,
"en": "I saw some guy in a uniform\nrunning 'round here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17049,
"en": "They playin' a night game or somethin'?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17050,
"en": "Ino-san. Have you seen Nagumo?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17051,
"en": "Yeah, jus' now.\nIt ain't good.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17052,
"en": "Nagumo was gettin' dragged off by a group o'\nyakuza. I was just goin' to Hirose for help.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17053,
"en": "That stupid bonehead!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17054,
"en": "A weak-ass punk like him never\nshoulda gone n' joined the yakuza!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17055,
"en": "Where did you see them?\nAnd where were they going?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17056,
"en": "Looked like the top o' the hill.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17057,
"en": "Y'don't gotta go yerself, Kiryu-san.\nJus' let the Hirose Family handle Nagumo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17058,
"en": "I can't afford to wait that long.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17059,
"en": "I've seen how strong y'are,\nbut y'can't take on the yakuza by yerself.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17060,
"en": "Those guys're way tougher than Nagumo.\nThere were a bunch of 'em, too!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17061,
"en": "I know that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17062,
"en": "So, where's this hill you mentioned?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17063,
"en": "Up at the top o' the ropeway.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17064,
"en": "The tram's not runnin' at night, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17065,
"en": "If y'wanna head up there now,\nyer gonna hafta take the footpath!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17066,
"en": "Thanks for the info.\nI'm going to head up there now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17067,
"en": "Look, y'don't gotta do this. Jus' wait for\nhis family. Nobody's expectin' yer help.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17068,
"en": "Y'know how they're holdin' ya right now?\nIt's called the jet style.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17069,
"en": "In ancient China, this is how they used\nt'punish traitors. Suits ya, don't it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17070,
"en": "What're y'doin' here?\nAin't you the guy from the bar?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17071,
"en": "K-Kiryu?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17072,
"en": "You were really stupid enough t'follow\nus all the way up here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17073,
"en": "Why d'ya care about Nagumo so much, huh?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17074,
"en": "Because I'm his fighting rival now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17075,
"en": "Your fighting rival?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17076,
"en": "G-Get outta here, Kiryu! Y'can't go stickin'\nyer nose into yakuza business, dumbass!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17077,
"en": "Yakuza or not, I don't really care.\nThese guys made my baby cry.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17078,
"en": "And I'm not walking away until I get\nan apology for that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17079,
"en": "Y'been drinkin', old man?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17080,
"en": "If y'wanna pick a fight with us,\nwe'd be real glad to oblige.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17081,
"en": "Can't guarantee you'll live, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17082,
"en": "I don't want to fight you, but I'll do\nwhat I have to if you won't apologize.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17083,
"en": "Wh-What're y'doin', Kiryu!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17084,
"en": "The Masuzoe Family ain't gonna forgive\nya for this. Yer diggin' yer own grave!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17085,
"en": "You're worried about me now?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17086,
"en": "Y-Ya dumbass!\nWhy would I be worried!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17087,
"en": "It's just, if ya get yerself killed by these\nguys, Kiyo-chan's gonna be real sad.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17088,
"en": "You're not such a bad guy after all.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17089,
"en": "You two lovebirds done yappin'!?\nHow long d'we gotta listen to this!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17090,
"en": "Yer an interestin' fella, though.\nI'll spare yer life this time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17091,
"en": "Let's give 'im his fight. I'm sure he'll\nsober up once he gets a piece o' us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17092,
"en": "Uh, I gotta warn ya, though... This guy\nain't just yer run o'the mill civilian...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17093,
"en": "Y'really beat 'em...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17094,
"en": "I don't get it. Those're Masuzoe yakuza.\nAnd there were five of 'em...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17095,
"en": "Man... Yer really somethin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17096,
"en": "Can you stand, Nagumo?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17097,
"en": "Kiryu-san. Why'd y'come n'\nsave an asshole like me?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17098,
"en": "A man always wants to impress\nthe woman he loves, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17099,
"en": "Anyone would agree with that. They can't\nlook weak in front of her, no matter what.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17100,
"en": "They need to stay strong for her.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17101,
"en": "But, when push comes to shove,\nnot many would risk their lives over it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17102,
"en": "Back in the bar, you stood your ground when\nmost would have crumbled. That took guts.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17103,
"en": "I couldn't let a guy like that wind up dead.\nSo I figured I'd come up here and save you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17104,
"en": "Guess I lose.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17105,
"en": "I ain't ever gonna beat a guy like that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17106,
"en": "I don't even mind losin' Kiyo-chan if y'were\nthe one to take her. I'd step aside fer ya.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17107,
"en": "Don't worry.\nI didn't come for her.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17108,
"en": "Either way, so long as yer hangin' around,\nKiyo-chan'd never go fer an idiot like me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17109,
"en": "Forget that fer now, though.\nI jus' decided somethin'!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17110,
"en": "What now?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main03|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17111,
"en": "Please. After you, Aniki.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17112,
"en": "Huh!? What the hell? Cap?\nThis guy is<symbol=em_dash_with_outline>",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17113,
"en": "Shut yer trap!\nY'oughta be showin' some respect!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17114,
"en": "This guy's my aniki now!\nAnd you fools'll call him aniki too!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17115,
"en": "Aniki, this is the Hirose Family office.\nY'can use it however y'want.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17116,
"en": "Hey Cap, is it true what Ino-san said\nabout Masuzoe gettin' the drop on you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17117,
"en": "Now ain't the time fer that, Yuta!\nGo n' grab us some drinks!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17118,
"en": "Uh, right...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17119,
"en": "Oh, that a light on?\nIs the patriarch here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17120,
"en": "Yeah, he said he's free for a bit.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17121,
"en": "Now that's good timin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17122,
"en": "Aniki, lemme introduce ya t'our\npatriarch. C'mon in.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17123,
"en": "Hold on, Nagumo. You're not going to\nask me to swear an oath, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17124,
"en": "I only came to say hi.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17125,
"en": "I know that.\nNow, go on.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17126,
"en": "What's goin' on? Yer embarrassin'\nus in front of our guest.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17127,
"en": "Huh? You all good, Tagashira?\nYer nose's bleedin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17128,
"en": "It's Matsunaga-aniki. There's a gang\nof dudes startin' a ruckus.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17129,
"en": "We gotta go help 'im.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17130,
"en": "Huh? What happened?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17131,
"en": "These customers were talkin' shit on us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17132,
"en": "Sayin' the food sucks, it's too expensive,\nthe women're ugly...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17133,
"en": "And? Ain't that all true?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17134,
"en": "Well yeah, but it got t'Matsunaga-aniki.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17135,
"en": "He punched one of 'em right in the face.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17136,
"en": "What was he thinkin' doin' that!?\nY'can't just smack yer customers around.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17137,
"en": "I can explain, Cap.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17138,
"en": "Earlier today, we got our asses\nhanded to us by Kiryu-san here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17139,
"en": "Well, news of that's been spreading.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17140,
"en": "Matsunaga-aniki couldn't just stand by while\nthey mocked the family, and he snapped.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17141,
"en": "I ain't helpin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17142,
"en": "Y'can't run a bar if yer gonna beat yer\ncustomers up over every little thing.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17143,
"en": "This is on Matsunaga.\nLet 'em hit 'im.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17144,
"en": "Y'can't be serious!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 17145,
"en": "He's goin' up against ten guys!\nThey're gonna kill him!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main04|#",
"max": null
}
]